    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis, with Goldbeter (2007) RA/FGF8 bistable switch and 2D cell-based PSM strip (Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites))",
        "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis, with Goldbeter (2007) RA/FGF8 bistable switch and 2D cell-based PSM strip faithfully reproduces Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites) morphology" ;
