        "reconstructed_in_script: Characteristic-upwind 1D advection-decay PDE solver dm/dt + v_g dm/dx = -k_d m (L2 relative error 0.0009 vs analytical exponential)",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Goldbeter-type 3-variable RA/FGF8/Cyp26 switch coupled to the mRNA gradient: saddle-nodes m_SN_lo = 0.184 / m_SN_hi = 0.546, hysteretic cell-trajectory front x_sw = 720.4 um, transition width 198 um vs 792 um, reverse switch at m = 0.675",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Lab-frame FGF8 wavefront-gated somite boundary simulator across wild-type, ectopic FGF8 bead (S_ant = 97.5 um, S_post = 202.5 um), SU5402 (S = 215.0 um) and k_d = 0 ablation control (N = 0 somites) - with the perturbation shifts entered as constants, not derived",
        "reported_in_source: Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427:419-422 cell-autonomous fgf8 mRNA decay gradient m(x) = m_0 exp(-k_d x / v_g) generated by tailbud-restricted transcription and axis elongation",
        "reported_in_source: Dubrulle, McGrew & Pourquie (2001) Cell 106:219-232 determination front threshold positioning x* = (v_g/k_d) ln(m_0/m_crit) and ectopic FGF8 bead / SU5402 somite size perturbations",
