<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-specimen-match> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquié (2001, 2004) FGF8 mRNA decay wavefront and determination front positioning in vertebrate somitogenesis, with Goldbeter (2007) RA/FGF8 bistable switch and 2D cell-based PSM strip — Morphological realism / specimen match: 85/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Panels D-F still carry the only specimen comparison: the SHA-256-pinned Wikimedia SEM is segmented into two bilateral somite rows (8 and 9 somites, 48.47 px spacing, symmetry 0.9606) and its band-pass profile is compared with a phase-aligned periodic model (r = 0.563). Pass 3 adds a rendered 2D tissue (Panel H) with visibly segmented, mildly jagged somite blocks (boundary roughness 19 um, somite CV 0.22) whose irregularity is of the same order as the specimen's spacing CV (0.20). Deductions: the 2D strip is not compared with the specimen at all - no boundary-straightness or somite-count comparison between Panel H and Panel E (-6); the specimen's species is labelled \"avian/vertebrate\" and is not confirmed as chick, so the organism claim rests on the Wikimedia title (-4); the profile correlation r = 0.563 is modest and the synthetic wave is fitted in phase and wavelength to the specimen itself (-5)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py L1329–L1357: Panel H renders the 2D cell strip with per-row somite boundaries and fronts but has no overlay/comparison with the SEM rows <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L1329-L1357>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-specimen-match-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-specimen-match-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-specimen-match-3> ;
    pk1:hasScore 8.5e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

