<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-audit-v3-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-6> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter RA/FGF8 bistable-switch hysteretic determination front x_sw (cell trajectory)" ;
    dct:description "Goldbeter-Gonze-Pourquie (2007) RA -| FGF -> Cyp26 -| RA switch integrated along a PSM cell trajectory m = m_0 e^(-k_d t); RA half-range crossing (saddle-node x_SN = 610.0 um, m_SN_lo = 0.184)" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle et al. (2001) Cell 106:219-232 threshold-front estimate x* = (v_g/k_d) ln(m_0/m_crit); Goldbeter et al. (2007) Dev. Dyn. 236:1495-1508 (bistability mechanism)" ;
    rdfs:comment "switch vs graded threshold: transition width 198.3 um vs 792.5 um (sharpening ratio 4.00x); hysteresis: reverse switch needs m >= 0.675 vs forward m_SN_lo = 0.184 (bistable window 392 um); parameters are this script's bistable-regime choice, not the paper's table" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
    schema:about "Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites)" ;
    schema:error 3.4398e+00 ;
    schema:targetValue 6.9646e+02 ;
    schema:unitText "um" ;
    schema:value 7.20417e+02 .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-audit-v3-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-7> a schema:QuantitativeValue,
        pk:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "RA/FGF8 bistable (hysteresis) window width along the PSM x_SN_lo - x_SN_hi" ;
    dct:description "steady-state branch scan of the 3-variable switch over m in (0, m_0]; saddle-nodes at m_SN_lo = 0.184, m_SN_hi = 0.546 mapped by x = lambda_m ln(m_0/m)" ;
    dct:source "Closed form lambda_m * ln(m_SN_hi / m_SN_lo) from the same saddle-node pair (internal consistency); Goldbeter et al. (2007) report bistability but no chick window length" ;
    rdfs:comment "posterior reverse-switch position x_SN_hi = 218.1 um, anterior forward-switch x_SN_lo = 610.0 um; dynamic (slow-passage) lag x_sw - x_SN_lo = 110.5 um at tau_sw = 10 min" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
    schema:about "Gallus gallus (chick embryo presomitic mesoderm & paraxial somites)" ;
    schema:error 5e-04 ;
    schema:targetValue 3.91877e+02 ;
    schema:unitText "um" ;
    schema:value 3.91879e+02 .

