<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Cell-Autonomous fgf8 mRNA Advection-Decay PDE" ;
    dct:description "Converts temporal intracellular fgf8 mRNA decay in tailbud-derived cells into a steady spatial exponential gradient along the presomitic mesoderm | Variables: m(x,t): intracellular fgf8 mRNA concentration; v_g: posterior tailbud axis elongation velocity (um/min); k_d: fgf8 mRNA decay rate constant (min^-1)" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427(6973):419-422 Figs. 1-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L154-L213>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L24-L43> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def fgf8_advection_decay_residual (v_g dm_dx k_d m : Int) : Int :=
  v_g * dm_dx + k_d * m
theorem dubrulle_2004_advection_decay_characteristic_balance (v_g k_d c : Int) :
    fgf8_advection_decay_residual v_g (-(k_d * c)) k_d (v_g * c) = 0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dm/dt + v_g * dm/dx = -k_d * m  =>  m(x) = m_0 * exp(-k_d * x / v_g)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.fgf8_advection_decay_residual" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2004_advection_decay_characteristic_balance" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle et al. (2001, 2004) Determination Front Threshold Positioning Law" ;
    dct:description "Positions the PSM determination front (somite level -IV/-III boundary) where decaying FGF8 falls below m_crit to unlock Mesp2/cMeso-1 activation | Variables: x_star: distance from posterior tailbud to determination front (um); m_0: tailbud fgf8 mRNA level; m_crit: permissive FGF threshold for segmentation competence" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle, McGrew & Pourquie (2001) Cell 106(2):219-232 Figs. 2-4; Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427:419-422" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L220-L235>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L45-L66> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def determination_front_position (lambda_m L_log : Nat) : Nat :=
  lambda_m * L_log
theorem dubrulle_2001_determination_front_scaling (k lambda_m L_log delta_L : Nat) :
    determination_front_position (k * lambda_m) L_log =
      k * determination_front_position lambda_m L_log ∧
    determination_front_position lambda_m (L_log + delta_L) =
      determination_front_position lambda_m L_log + lambda_m * delta_L"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "x_star = (v_g / k_d) * ln(m_0 / m_crit)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.determination_front_position" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2001_determination_front_scaling" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle et al. (2001) Ectopic FGF8 Bead & SU5402 Somite Size Perturbation Law" ;
    dct:description "Explains why an ectopic FGF8 bead grafted into the PSM produces compressed small somites anterior to the bead followed by an enlarged catch-up somite posterior to the bead while SU5402 produces enlarged somites | Variables: S_n: anteroposterior length of somite n (um); T_c: segmentation clock period (min); delta_x: transient anterior displacement of determination front by ectopic FGF8 bead (um)" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle, McGrew & Pourquie (2001) Cell 106(2):219-232 Figs. 1-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L238-L291>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L68-L87> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def perturbed_somite_length (v_g T_c delta_x : Int) : Int :=
  v_g * T_c - delta_x
theorem dubrulle_2001_fgf8_bead_somite_pair_conservation (v_g T_c delta_x : Int) :
    perturbed_somite_length v_g T_c delta_x +
      perturbed_somite_length v_g T_c (-delta_x) = 2 * (v_g * T_c)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "S_n = v_g * T_c - Delta_x_star_n;  S_ant + S_post = (v_g * T_c - delta_x) + (v_g * T_c + delta_x) = 2 * v_g * T_c" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.perturbed_somite_length" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2001_fgf8_bead_somite_pair_conservation" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) RA/FGF8 Mutual-Inhibition Bistable Determination Switch (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Replaces the graded threshold m(x*) = m_crit by a hysteretic bistable switch (double-negative RA -| FGF -> Cyp26 -| RA loop) that sharpens the determination front (transition width 198 um vs 792 um for the graded model) and gives the front memory (reverse switch requires m >= m_SN_hi) | Variables: F: FGF signaling; X: Cyp26 (RA-degrading enzyme); RA: retinoic acid; m(x): tailbud-derived fgf8 mRNA input (Law 1); K_I, K_A, K_C: half-saturation constants; n: Hill coefficient; m_SN_lo, m_SN_hi: saddle-node inputs bounding the bistable window" ;
    dct:source "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Developmental Dynamics 236(6):1495-1508 (functional forms; parameter values are this script's bistable-regime choice)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L295-L506>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L97-L150> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def feedback_loop_sign (e₁ e₂ : Int) : Int := e₁ * e₂
theorem goldbeter_2007_double_negative_loop_is_positive (s₁ s₂ : Int)
    (h₁ : 0 < s₁) (h₂ : 0 < s₂) :
    feedback_loop_sign (-s₁) (-s₂) = s₁ * s₂ ∧ 0 < feedback_loop_sign (-s₁) (-s₂)
def hysteretic_state (x_lo x_hi x : Int) (prev : Bool) : Bool :=
  if x ≤ x_lo then true else if x_hi ≤ x then false else prev
theorem goldbeter_2007_hysteretic_switch_memory (x_lo x_hi x : Int)
    (hlo : x_lo < x) (hhi : x < x_hi) :
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x true = true ∧
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x false = false ∧
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x_hi true = false ∧
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x_lo false = true ∧
    0 < x_hi - x_lo"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dF/dt = v_F m(x) K_I^n/(K_I^n + RA^n) - k_F F;  dX/dt = v_X F^n/(K_A^n + F^n) - k_X X;  dRA/dt = v_R - k_R RA - k_C X RA/(K_C + RA);  bistable for m in [m_SN_lo, m_SN_hi];  hysteretic front x_SN = lambda_m ln(m_0/m_SN_lo)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.hysteretic_state" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.goldbeter_2007_hysteretic_switch_memory" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Cell-Autonomous fgf8 mRNA Dilution by Tailbud Progenitor Division (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Makes mRNA dilution by tailbud cell division explicit in the 2D cell-based strip (Section 4b): one division equals one half-life of decay, the periodic exported level follows the closed form, and removing division at fixed transcription shifts the front anteriorly by 271 um at T_div = 480 min (simulated 276 um) | Variables: D: decay drop in half-lives (k_d tau / ln 2); n: number of cell divisions; k_s: tailbud fgf8 transcription rate; T_div: progenitor cell-cycle time; m_exit: post-division level exported into the PSM; Delta_x_dil: anterior front shift when division is removed at fixed k_s" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427(6973):419-422 (cell-autonomous mRNA decay/dilution); closed forms derived in this script" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L616-L900>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L152-L171> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def log2_fgf8_level (L0 D n : Int) : Int :=
  L0 - D - n
theorem dubrulle_2004_division_dilution_is_one_half_life (L0 D₁ D₂ n₁ n₂ : Int) :
    log2_fgf8_level (log2_fgf8_level L0 D₁ n₁) D₂ n₂ =
      log2_fgf8_level L0 (D₁ + D₂) (n₁ + n₂) ∧
    log2_fgf8_level L0 D₁ (n₁ + 1) = log2_fgf8_level L0 (D₁ + 1) n₁"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "log2 m = log2 m_0 - D - n;  m_exit = (k_s/k_d) (1 - e^(-k_d T_div)) / (2 - e^(-k_d T_div));  Delta_x_dil = lambda_m ln[(2 - e^(-k_d T_div)) / (1 - e^(-k_d T_div))]" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.log2_fgf8_level" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2004_division_dilution_is_one_half_life" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Cell-Autonomous fgf8 mRNA Advection-Decay PDE" ;
    dct:description "Converts temporal intracellular fgf8 mRNA decay in tailbud-derived cells into a steady spatial exponential gradient along the presomitic mesoderm | Variables: m(x,t): intracellular fgf8 mRNA concentration; v_g: posterior tailbud axis elongation velocity (um/min); k_d: fgf8 mRNA decay rate constant (min^-1)" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427(6973):419-422 Figs. 1-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L154-L213>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L24-L43> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def fgf8_advection_decay_residual (v_g dm_dx k_d m : Int) : Int :=
  v_g * dm_dx + k_d * m
theorem dubrulle_2004_advection_decay_characteristic_balance (v_g k_d c : Int) :
    fgf8_advection_decay_residual v_g (-(k_d * c)) k_d (v_g * c) = 0"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dm/dt + v_g * dm/dx = -k_d * m  =>  m(x) = m_0 * exp(-k_d * x / v_g)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.fgf8_advection_decay_residual" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2004_advection_decay_characteristic_balance" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle et al. (2001, 2004) Determination Front Threshold Positioning Law" ;
    dct:description "Positions the PSM determination front (somite level -IV/-III boundary) where decaying FGF8 falls below m_crit to unlock Mesp2/cMeso-1 activation | Variables: x_star: distance from posterior tailbud to determination front (um); m_0: tailbud fgf8 mRNA level; m_crit: permissive FGF threshold for segmentation competence" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle, McGrew & Pourquie (2001) Cell 106(2):219-232 Figs. 2-4; Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427:419-422" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L220-L235>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L45-L66> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def determination_front_position (lambda_m L_log : Nat) : Nat :=
  lambda_m * L_log
theorem dubrulle_2001_determination_front_scaling (k lambda_m L_log delta_L : Nat) :
    determination_front_position (k * lambda_m) L_log =
      k * determination_front_position lambda_m L_log ∧
    determination_front_position lambda_m (L_log + delta_L) =
      determination_front_position lambda_m L_log + lambda_m * delta_L"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "x_star = (v_g / k_d) * ln(m_0 / m_crit)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.determination_front_position" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2001_determination_front_scaling" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle et al. (2001) Ectopic FGF8 Bead & SU5402 Somite Size Perturbation Law" ;
    dct:description "Explains why an ectopic FGF8 bead grafted into the PSM produces compressed small somites anterior to the bead followed by an enlarged catch-up somite posterior to the bead while SU5402 produces enlarged somites | Variables: S_n: anteroposterior length of somite n (um); T_c: segmentation clock period (min); delta_x: transient anterior displacement of determination front by ectopic FGF8 bead (um)" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle, McGrew & Pourquie (2001) Cell 106(2):219-232 Figs. 1-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L238-L291>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L68-L87> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def perturbed_somite_length (v_g T_c delta_x : Int) : Int :=
  v_g * T_c - delta_x
theorem dubrulle_2001_fgf8_bead_somite_pair_conservation (v_g T_c delta_x : Int) :
    perturbed_somite_length v_g T_c delta_x +
      perturbed_somite_length v_g T_c (-delta_x) = 2 * (v_g * T_c)"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "S_n = v_g * T_c - Delta_x_star_n;  S_ant + S_post = (v_g * T_c - delta_x) + (v_g * T_c + delta_x) = 2 * v_g * T_c" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.perturbed_somite_length" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2001_fgf8_bead_somite_pair_conservation" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) RA/FGF8 Mutual-Inhibition Bistable Determination Switch (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Replaces the graded threshold m(x*) = m_crit by a hysteretic bistable switch (double-negative RA -| FGF -> Cyp26 -| RA loop) that sharpens the determination front (transition width 198 um vs 792 um for the graded model) and gives the front memory (reverse switch requires m >= m_SN_hi) | Variables: F: FGF signaling; X: Cyp26 (RA-degrading enzyme); RA: retinoic acid; m(x): tailbud-derived fgf8 mRNA input (Law 1); K_I, K_A, K_C: half-saturation constants; n: Hill coefficient; m_SN_lo, m_SN_hi: saddle-node inputs bounding the bistable window" ;
    dct:source "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Developmental Dynamics 236(6):1495-1508 (functional forms; parameter values are this script's bistable-regime choice)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L295-L506>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L97-L150> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def feedback_loop_sign (e₁ e₂ : Int) : Int := e₁ * e₂
theorem goldbeter_2007_double_negative_loop_is_positive (s₁ s₂ : Int)
    (h₁ : 0 < s₁) (h₂ : 0 < s₂) :
    feedback_loop_sign (-s₁) (-s₂) = s₁ * s₂ ∧ 0 < feedback_loop_sign (-s₁) (-s₂)
def hysteretic_state (x_lo x_hi x : Int) (prev : Bool) : Bool :=
  if x ≤ x_lo then true else if x_hi ≤ x then false else prev
theorem goldbeter_2007_hysteretic_switch_memory (x_lo x_hi x : Int)
    (hlo : x_lo < x) (hhi : x < x_hi) :
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x true = true ∧
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x false = false ∧
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x_hi true = false ∧
    hysteretic_state x_lo x_hi x_lo false = true ∧
    0 < x_hi - x_lo"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dF/dt = v_F m(x) K_I^n/(K_I^n + RA^n) - k_F F;  dX/dt = v_X F^n/(K_A^n + F^n) - k_X X;  dRA/dt = v_R - k_R RA - k_C X RA/(K_C + RA);  bistable for m in [m_SN_lo, m_SN_hi];  hysteretic front x_SN = lambda_m ln(m_0/m_SN_lo)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.hysteretic_state" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.goldbeter_2007_hysteretic_switch_memory" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Cell-Autonomous fgf8 mRNA Dilution by Tailbud Progenitor Division (Pass 3)" ;
    dct:description "Makes mRNA dilution by tailbud cell division explicit in the 2D cell-based strip (Section 4b): one division equals one half-life of decay, the periodic exported level follows the closed form, and removing division at fixed transcription shifts the front anteriorly by 271 um at T_div = 480 min (simulated 276 um) | Variables: D: decay drop in half-lives (k_d tau / ln 2); n: number of cell divisions; k_s: tailbud fgf8 transcription rate; T_div: progenitor cell-cycle time; m_exit: post-division level exported into the PSM; Delta_x_dil: anterior front shift when division is removed at fixed k_s" ;
    dct:source "Dubrulle & Pourquie (2004) Nature 427(6973):419-422 (cell-autonomous mRNA decay/dilution); closed forms derived in this script" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2003-dubrulle-fgf8-wavefront-somitogenesis.py#L616-L900>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_024_fgf8_wavefront_somitogenesis.lean#L152-L171> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def log2_fgf8_level (L0 D n : Int) : Int :=
  L0 - D - n
theorem dubrulle_2004_division_dilution_is_one_half_life (L0 D₁ D₂ n₁ n₂ : Int) :
    log2_fgf8_level (log2_fgf8_level L0 D₁ n₁) D₂ n₂ =
      log2_fgf8_level L0 (D₁ + D₂) (n₁ + n₂) ∧
    log2_fgf8_level L0 D₁ (n₁ + 1) = log2_fgf8_level L0 (D₁ + 1) n₁"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "log2 m = log2 m_0 - D - n;  m_exit = (k_s/k_d) (1 - e^(-k_d T_div)) / (2 - e^(-k_d T_div));  Delta_x_dil = lambda_m ln[(2 - e^(-k_d T_div)) / (1 - e^(-k_d T_div))]" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature02332>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature09151> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Advection-Reaction mRNA Decay Wavefront & Threshold Phase-Gating (Somitogenesis)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.log2_fgf8_level" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_024.dubrulle_2004_division_dilution_is_one_half_life" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

